{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09204","headline":"荅长宁令杨辙 · 韦应物","name":"荅长宁令杨辙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皓月升林表，公堂满清辉。\n嘉宾自远至，觞饮夜何其。\n宰邑视京县，归来无寸资。\n瓌文溢衆宝，雅正得吾师。\n广川含澄澜，茂树擢华滋。\n短才何足数，枉赠媿妍词。\n欢盼良见属，素怀亦已披。\n何意云栖翰，不嫌蓬艾卑。\n但恐河汉没，回车首路岐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09204.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09204","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}